OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham cleared
OL,4,Aof abusing position
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Sheriff of Nottingham has
OL,7,Fbeen cleared of abusing his position to
OL,8,Fsecure a discount on car repairs and
OL,9,Ffree hospitality after a committee
OL,10,Fconcluded a code of conduct breach was
OL,11,F"technical".
OL,13,FNottingham City Council Labour
OL,14,Fcouncillor Zafran Khan was found by an
OL,15,Fexternal investigation to have breached
OL,16,Fthe code of conduct, following a
OL,17,Fcomplaint in 2025.
OL,19,FThat report alleged there had been
OL,20,Feight breaches of the code by Khan, who
OL,21,Fheld the civic role as sheriff until
OL,22,FMay this year.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
