OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham cleared
OL,4,Aof abusing position
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut on Thursday, the council's
OL,7,FStandards and Governance Committee
OL,8,Ffound Khan only committed one
OL,9,F"technical breach" of the code by
OL,10,Ffailing to declare his attendance at a
OL,11,Fconcert arena within a 28-day period.
